==Battleground==
*6 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Satanmaria (Enemy)|Satanmaria]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

